# org-target: docs/10-19-design/10-architecture/10.22-domain-library-delivery-and-native-admission.org::#domain-library-delivery
# render-layout: elk; theme: 0; pad: 24; timeout: 30
direction: down
baseline: "Qualification baseline / moving Core isolated\nCaptured Core source + unchanged project source\nStandard Gerbil load path; primary package link preserved\nTwo live-source refusals retained"
parent: "Parent Library / concurrency resource control\nBackpressure model + rules + required dependencies\nExisting Core Module publication"
rust: "Rust specialization / required parent\nPOO composition preserves parent obligations\nContracts retain required activation factors\nTokio/Rayon lifecycle and correspondence obligations"
selection: "Existing Core selected graph\nParent-only selection excludes unrelated owners\nSelecting malformed owner must reject"
capture: "Native Scenario / one POO capture\nProfile + crate + Cargo.lock + tools + usage\nSeven unique scopes + snapshot\nRecompute at review admission"
cargo_config: "Actual Cargo execution directory\nSame configuration search as selected root\nCheck before and after commands\nAn unbound override rejects before tools run"
methods: "Actual bounded methods\nQNT/TLC + independent finite oracle\nLean conditional arithmetic\nSix native Rust lifecycle cases + independent event oracle"
ascent: "Existing ASCENT evidence relations\nRegister issued results / original provenance\nStable model reuse; changed source correspondence becomes pending\nKeep counter and immutable historical evidence"
agent: "LLM-based AI agent\nDiscover rules; choose checks and repairs\nNo self-issued evidence or use authority"
seal: "Existing Core currentness seal\nProject and selected compiler-tool input closure\nDrift retains raw evidence and refuses a current report\nFresh reader; serialized JSON does not restore issuer authority"
accepted: "LOCAL OWNER SLICE QUALIFIED\n22 actual records / 9 queries / 7 exchanges\n18 passes and 4 expected negative controls\nSource stability + native gold audit + worker 1/2 ABI\nCaptured Core baseline; no whole-framework acceptance"
remaining: "OPEN gates\nG2 bounded consumer delivered / authority pending\nG3 broadcast close/wake\nG4 selected Benchmark and matched measurements\nNo atomic use authorization or performance claim"
parent -> rust: "requires Parent"
selection -> parent
rust -> capture -> cargo_config -> methods -> ascent
agent -> capture: "select Profile and investigation"
ascent -> agent: "support / counter / pending"
ascent -> seal -> accepted -> remaining

baseline -> selection
